WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.897
Von Buzz touched his helmet.

2
00:00:05.898 --> 00:00:09.526
"Fly away," he said.

3
00:00:09.527 --> 00:00:13.449
The bee grabbed Von Buzz and flew off.

4
00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:16.933
The centipede and spider followed.

5
00:00:16.934 --> 00:00:21.686
"Grr!" Roxy struggled and squirmed on the web.

6
00:00:21.687 --> 00:00:24.630
"This spider web is too sticky!"

7
00:00:24.631 --> 00:00:26.446
She stopped moving.

8
00:00:26.447 --> 00:00:29.246
"I'll try my heat vision."

9
00:00:29.247 --> 00:00:31.916
Roxy turned her head toward the web.

10
00:00:31.917 --> 00:00:37.295
An orange beam radiated from her eyes.

11
00:00:37.296 --> 00:00:41.183
The spider web melted, and Roxy was free!

12
00:00:41.184 --> 00:00:44.093
"Whew!" said Roxy.

13
00:00:44.094 --> 00:00:48.195
"Now I have to find Von Buzz and destroy his helmet.

14
00:00:48.196 --> 00:00:53.535
He uses it to control those big bugs."

15
00:00:53.536 --> 00:00:56.810
Roxy found Von Buzz two blocks away.

16
00:00:56.811 --> 00:01:01.207
His bugs were breaking into another house.

17
00:01:01.208 --> 00:01:03.293
The villain saw Roxy.

18
00:01:03.294 --> 00:01:06.055
"How did you escape?" he cried.

19
00:01:06.056 --> 00:01:09.224
Von Buzz touched his helmet and looked at the bee.

20
00:01:09.225 --> 00:01:11.818
"Attack Rocket Girl!"

21
00:01:11.819 --> 00:01:13.926
The bee shot toward Roxy.

22
00:01:13.927 --> 00:01:16.931
Its giant stinger was pointed right at her.

23
00:01:16.932 --> 00:01:20.932
"Yikes!" cried Roxy, quickly moving out of the way.

24
00:01:20.933 --> 00:01:23.579
The bee crashed into a tree.

25
00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:26.333
Its stinger stuck into the tree's trunk.

26
00:01:26.334 --> 00:01:30.066
Buzz! The bee tried to pull its stinger out.

27
00:01:30.067 --> 00:01:32.776
But the stinger was in too deep.

28
00:01:32.777 --> 00:01:37.151
"Aargh!" Von Buzz looked next at the spider.

29
00:01:37.152 --> 00:01:40.295
"Attack Rocket Girl!"

30
00:01:40.296 --> 00:01:44.554
Fwit! Fwit! Spider webs shot toward Roxy.

31
00:01:44.555 --> 00:01:45.954
She took a deep breath.

32
00:01:45.955 --> 00:01:50.078
Whoosh! She blew as hard as she could.

33
00:01:50.079 --> 00:01:53.594
The webs flew back at the spider and stuck to its legs.

34
00:01:53.595 --> 00:01:55.746
The spider fell over.

35
00:01:55.747 --> 00:01:59.423
"Attack Rocket Girl!" cried Von Buzz.

36
00:01:59.424 --> 00:02:01.459
He looked at the centipede.

37
00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:05.265
The centipede just curled up into a ball again.

38
00:02:05.266 --> 00:02:07.395
Roxy glared at Von Buzz.

39
00:02:07.396 --> 00:02:11.380
Whiz-hoo! She fired her eye laser beams.

40
00:02:11.381 --> 00:02:16.973
Von Buzz's helmet blew apart.

41
00:02:16.974 --> 00:02:20.976
"No!" cried Von Buzz.

42
00:02:20.977 --> 00:02:24.528
Roxy dragged Von Buzz down the street.

43
00:02:24.529 --> 00:02:26.614
She found Detective Smith.

44
00:02:26.615 --> 00:02:28.789
Mr. Wig was with him.

45
00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:34.200
"Here you go, Detective," she said.

46
00:02:34.201 --> 00:02:37.675
"Well done, young lady," said Mr. Wig.

47
00:02:37.676 --> 00:02:40.777
"You're more super than I'd realized.

48
00:02:40.778 --> 00:02:43.539
I'd like to give you a reward."

49
00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:46.351
Roxy saw her friends coming.

50
00:02:46.352 --> 00:02:49.176
"Thanks, Mr. Wig," said Roxy.

51
00:02:49.177 --> 00:02:52.122
"But I have a better idea.

52
00:02:52.123 --> 00:02:54.741
You can help out those kids."

53
00:02:54.742 --> 00:02:57.738
"Rocket Girl!" cried Terrell.

54
00:02:57.739 --> 00:03:02.287
"Does anyone want to buy some candy bars?" asked Mara.

55
00:03:02.288 --> 00:03:07.001
Roxy smiled. "Mr. Wig would like to buy some."

56
00:03:07.002 --> 00:03:10.706
"Oh, um, yes," said Mr. Wig.

57
00:03:10.707 --> 00:03:15.444
"I'll buy every candy bar you have!"

58
00:03:15.445 --> 00:03:18.957
Roxy found her friends again a few minutes later.

59
00:03:18.958 --> 00:03:22.682
"We sold all our candy bars!" said Jack.

60
00:03:22.683 --> 00:03:27.433
"And guess what! Rocket Girl helped us!"

61
00:03:27.434 --> 00:03:32.405
"I knew she could help us sell candy bars," said Terrell.

62
00:03:32.406 --> 00:03:37.661
Roxy just smiled.

